    <!-- Sequencer -->
    <string name="sequencer_title">Sequencer</string>
    <string name="sequencer_hint">Each cell is one sequencer slot. [＋ Add cell] adds a cell; [Import .mid] in a cell assigns a MIDI file to that cell only; [Learn] binds a key or controller — press a key, or move a CC / pitch bend (re-tap to unbind); [−] removes the cell (the file stays on disk). The channel selector remaps ALL events of the file (incl. all-notes-off) to the chosen channel 1–16, matching the Instruments list; From file keeps the file\'s own channels.</string>

